              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: **विद्यालयः; छात्रः; अध्यापकः** — *vidyālayaḥ; chātraḥ; adhyāpakaḥ* — school; student; teacher]"
